Package: quichash
Version: 0.1.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: rust, curl, tar
Section: crypto
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vyrti/quichash
Description: High-performance cryptographic hash utility with SIMD optimization
 QuicHash hashes files, directories, stdin, and text with MD5, SHA-1,
 SHA-2/3, BLAKE2/3, and xxHash, using parallel processing by default.
 It also verifies checksum databases, finds duplicates, and writes
 QuicHash, hashdeep, and JSON reports.
